cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use naapurustot.fi data or pages in research or journalism, please cite it as below and credit the underlying open-data sources."
title: "naapurustot.fi — Finnish neighbourhood statistics"
abstract: >-
  A free, independent map service compiling 50+ open-data indicators —
  income, employment, education, housing, services, safety, transit and
  environment — for all 3,018 Finnish postal-code areas across 69 sub-regions
  (seutukunnat), with per-area profile pages, a Quality Index and an open bulk
  dataset. Every value traces to a verifiable public source. Data is licensed
  per source: Statistics Finland (Paavo) under CC BY 4.0, OpenStreetMap-derived
  columns under the ODbL; see the codebook for per-column licensing.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "naapurustot.fi"
    website: "https://naapurustot.fi"
url: "https://naapurustot.fi"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jvmarten/naapurustot"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
